OL,5,G0035 Warship: Life in the Royal Navy
OL,6,     FJJ Chalmers is put to the ultimate
OL,7,     FMarine training test, and also
OL,8,     Fremotely drives an attack boat.
OL,9,     FJulia visits HMS Belfast to talk
OL,10,     Fto veterans about what naval life
OL,11,     Fwas like during WWII. (Ep3/3)
OL,12,G0135 Warship: Life on the Frontline
OL,13,     FJJ Chalmers gets exclusive access
OL,14,     Fto HMS Prince of Wales, the Royal
OL,15,     FNavy's biggest British warship as
OL,16,     Fshe prepares for the most
OL,17,     Fdangerous leg of its epic
OL,18,     Feight-month deployment.
